WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.259
Some things are sold for a date:

00:00:03.259 --> 00:00:07.658
a seat on a tour, a room for a few nights, an hour with a therapist.

00:00:07.658 --> 00:00:12.294
This video shows how the Bookings module sells them, with a capacity for

00:00:12.294 --> 00:00:17.585
each date, deposits, cancellation rules, requests you confirm first, and a list and

00:00:17.585 --> 00:00:20.200
calendar of everything that is booked.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.831
A shirt can be sold until the shelf is empty.

00:00:27.831 --> 00:00:31.457
A tour, a room or an appointment can only be sold for a

00:00:31.457 --> 00:00:35.380
date, and each date has room for a limited number of people.

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:38.018
Prices follow the booking:

00:00:38.018 --> 00:00:41.734
per person for a tour, per room for a stay, with a higher

00:00:41.734 --> 00:00:44.270
price in high season or on a weekend.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:48.798
Buyers expect to pay a deposit now and the rest later, and to

00:00:48.798 --> 00:00:50.602
know what canceling costs.

00:00:50.602 --> 00:00:53.760
You need to see what is booked, and who is coming.

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:58.900
The Bookings module sells all of this from the same catalog, cart and

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:01.300
checkout as the rest of your store.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.159
You add the Booking part to a product.

00:01:08.159 --> 00:01:09.911
It says what is booked:

00:01:09.911 --> 00:01:12.510
a date with seats, nights, or a time.

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:18.039
Each date has a capacity, and a date that is full cannot be bought.

00:01:18.039 --> 00:01:20.920
A tour has its own list of departures.

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:27.544
A deposit, a cancellation policy, a request to confirm first, and travelers' details

00:01:27.544 --> 00:01:30.090
are settings on the same product.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:36.331
Every booking appears under Commerce, Bookings, in a list and a calendar, where

00:01:36.331 --> 00:01:38.980
you confirm, complete or cancel it.

00:01:43.172 --> 00:01:45.741
Open the product and find Booking.

00:01:45.741 --> 00:01:50.752
What's booked is a date with seats, such as a tour, an event or a class.

00:01:51.207 --> 00:01:53.987
Capacity is how much each date holds:

00:01:53.987 --> 00:01:56.507
here twelve seats on a departure.

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:00.259
The price is per person is ticked for a price such as a

00:02:00.259 --> 00:02:02.963
tour's, charged for everyone in the booking.

00:02:02.963 --> 00:02:06.370
Leave it unticked for a price per room, whoever is in it.

00:02:06.823 --> 00:02:10.701
Under Options, add what a unit can be, such as a Double room

00:02:10.701 --> 00:02:13.463
for two people and a Single room for one.

00:02:13.463 --> 00:02:18.633
An option can add to the price once, such as a single supplement of three hundred.

00:02:19.086 --> 00:02:22.421
For a tour, Manage dates adds its departures.

00:02:22.421 --> 00:02:26.476
Publish the product first, then add its dates from here.

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:34.236
Manage dates lists the departures buyers can choose.

00:02:34.236 --> 00:02:38.908
Each shows its date, how many are booked, paid and held, its capacity,

00:02:38.908 --> 00:02:41.490
its price, and whether it is closed.

00:02:41.952 --> 00:02:44.103
Click Add date to add a departure.

00:02:44.103 --> 00:02:47.598
Give it a Date, its own Capacity, and, if you like, its own

00:02:47.598 --> 00:02:50.232
Price, such as a higher one in high season.

00:02:50.691 --> 00:02:51.656
Click Save.

00:02:51.656 --> 00:02:56.086
A date left at the product's own capacity and price shows The product's,

00:02:56.086 --> 00:02:58.301
and a full date cannot be bought.

00:03:02.502 --> 00:03:05.258
Choose Nights, such as a room or a rental.

00:03:05.258 --> 00:03:09.564
The buyer picks a check-in and a check-out, from the Fewest nights to

00:03:09.564 --> 00:03:11.402
the Most nights you allow.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:16.862
A weekend price replaces the product's price for Friday and Saturday nights.

00:03:16.862 --> 00:03:20.820
Days ahead is how far ahead nights and times can be booked.

00:03:21.274 --> 00:03:23.941
Choose A time, such as an appointment.

00:03:23.941 --> 00:03:28.003
Tick the days you are open, set when the first slot opens and

00:03:28.003 --> 00:03:32.004
when the last one closes, and how many Minutes a slot lasts.

00:03:36.198 --> 00:03:40.895
Enter a Deposit, as a percentage, and Rest due, in days before the date.

00:03:40.895 --> 00:03:44.088
At checkout the buyer can choose Pay a deposit:

00:03:44.088 --> 00:03:48.063
they pay that share now, and the rest is charged to the same

00:03:48.063 --> 00:03:49.448
card on its date.

00:03:49.902 --> 00:03:54.338
Under Cancellation policy, add a rule for each step, such as a ten

00:03:54.338 --> 00:03:59.267
percent fee when canceled at least sixty days before, and fifty percent at

00:03:59.267 --> 00:04:01.177
least thirty days before.

00:04:01.177 --> 00:04:04.442
Closer than the last rule, nothing is refunded.

00:04:04.895 --> 00:04:09.413
Tick Confirm each booking before it's paid for bookings you accept one by one.

00:04:09.413 --> 00:04:14.255
The buyer's cart then offers Request to book, and you send the quote from the order.

00:04:14.708 --> 00:04:19.252
Tick Ask for each traveler's details at checkout to ask for each person's

00:04:19.252 --> 00:04:22.818
name, or any field you add to the Traveler content type.

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:31.481
On the product's page, the buyer chooses a Date and an Option, and

00:04:31.481 --> 00:04:34.710
sees the deposit, and the cancellation policy.

00:04:35.962 --> 00:04:39.548
A date with its own price shows it, and a date that is

00:04:39.548 --> 00:04:41.102
full is not offered.

00:04:41.559 --> 00:04:45.597
At checkout, a booking that asks for travelers' details has a field for

00:04:45.597 --> 00:04:49.162
each person, in the Contact step, so that every name is on the

00:04:49.162 --> 00:04:53.199
booking and on the booking's page in your admin, where you can read it.

00:04:54.269 --> 00:04:58.722
The Find a date page lets shoppers enter dates and how many people.

00:04:58.722 --> 00:05:03.969
It lists what has room then, and links each to its product with the date chosen.

00:05:08.153 --> 00:05:10.088
Open Commerce, Bookings.

00:05:10.088 --> 00:05:16.023
It lists bookings from today on, with the product, the buyer, the status and the date.

00:05:16.477 --> 00:05:23.453
Filter by status, such as Requested, Confirmed, Completed, No-shows or Canceled, show any

00:05:23.453 --> 00:05:26.537
date, or search by buyer or product.

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:30.490
Calendar shows each day's dates with what is taken.

00:05:34.676 --> 00:05:36.769
Click a booking to open it.

00:05:36.769 --> 00:05:41.589
It shows its status, the buyer, what was booked, the price, the order,

00:05:41.589 --> 00:05:43.746
and each traveler's details.

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:48.353
A paid booking is Confirmed, and the buyer gets an email.

00:05:48.353 --> 00:05:53.100
After the date, mark it Complete, or No-show if they did not come.

00:05:53.551 --> 00:05:57.730
Cancel shows how many days before the date it is, what the policy

00:05:57.730 --> 00:06:00.731
keeps, and what is refunded of what was paid.

00:06:01.186 --> 00:06:05.053
Change the Refund to give back more or less, add a Reason, and

00:06:05.053 --> 00:06:06.816
click Cancel the booking.

00:06:06.816 --> 00:06:10.512
The money goes back to how they paid, what is still owed is

00:06:10.512 --> 00:06:14.266
let go, the date is free again, and the buyer gets an email.

00:06:18.466 --> 00:06:19.950
A tour operator:

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:25.956
departures with seats, a deposit now and the rest later, and a cancellation policy.

00:06:26.706 --> 00:06:28.959
A small hotel or a rental:

00:06:28.959 --> 00:06:33.326
rooms by the night, a weekend price, and a minimum stay.

00:06:34.076 --> 00:06:35.759
A clinic or a studio:

00:06:35.759 --> 00:06:39.936
appointments by the hour, in the days and hours you are open.

00:06:40.686 --> 00:06:42.850
A guide who vets each guest:

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:47.116
requests you confirm first, with a quote sent from the order.

00:06:49.116 --> 00:06:53.659
With the Bookings module, you sell dates, nights and times with a capacity

00:06:53.659 --> 00:06:56.499
for each, and see everything that is booked.

00:06:56.499 --> 00:06:57.976
Thanks for watching.

